{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方、\nありがとうございます＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/20/1310566/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/20/1310566/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浪漫の撮影とLessonでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は暑過ぎてびっくりした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/20/1310566/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...\n外にいること多かったから\n溶けるかと思ったよーーーーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あちかったああああ\nひーひーふー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんも塩分しっかりとって\n夏バテしないようにしましょう><"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/20/1310566/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*****"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかもてもて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/20/1310566/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真ん中のやつすんごうぇええぐぇ\nな顔してるけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/20/1310566/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、うしろに誰かいるわね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/20/1310566/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...そーかそーかんーんー\n若月も私のことそんなにすきなのか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*****"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東スポの連載は私です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/20/1310566/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/20/1310566/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"取材のときだらだら\nしゃべってしまって最強に\nまとまりのない話だったのに\n読んだらこんなにまとまってて..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/20/1310566/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/20/1310566/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかに少しでも、ほんの少しでも\nもうちょびっとでも\n興味がある方はちょーとでも\n読んでいただけると嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかふぁむのみなさんも読んでね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/20/1310566/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒に\n「ピーマンとナスとか\n普通に食べれるしっ」\nとか言われたぐわわわ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おしりぺんぺんしてやったよ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなにバカにされる私"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/20/1310566/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛称が「ベビたん」のままだった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/20/1310566/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けど、まりっか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/20/1310566/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*****"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/20/1310566/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねねがくつろいでるところ\nかまってあげてるんだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/20/1310566/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やさしいだろ  ⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日Lesson頑張ろう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんも頑張りまりか‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}